    "teach_3": {
      "id": "teach_3",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "A deadline question often gives the fraction already completed.\n\nSuppose 90 workers had 20 days left, but only 2/5 of the whole job is done and 3/5 remains. If their previous work rate implied a different pace, we size the remaining workforce directly from the remaining fraction.",
